#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your login credentials instead of manually entering them"
msgstr "Sauvegarder tes identifiants de connexion au lieu de les saisir manuellement"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your login credentials"
msgstr "Sauvegarder tes identifiants de connexion"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your login credentials {#save-your-login-credentials}"
msgstr "Sauvegarder tes identifiants de connexion {#save-your-login-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are working in a trusted Python environment (such as on a personal laptop or workstation), you can use the `save_account()` method to save your credentials locally, then use them to initialize the service.\n"
msgstr "Si tu travailles dans un environnement Python de confiance (par exemple sur un ordinateur portable personnel ou un poste de travail), tu peux utiliser la méthode `save_account()` pour sauvegarder tes identifiants localement, puis les utiliser pour initialiser le service.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"  * If you are using a public computer or other untrusted environment, follow the instructions in [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) instead.\n"
"  * Follow [these instructions](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) if you want to connect by using the REST API instead of using Qiskit.\n"
"  * If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) to configure your firewall to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Remarques\">\n"
"      * Si tu utilises un ordinateur public ou tout autre environnement non fiable, suis plutôt les instructions de la page [Initialiser le service dans un environnement non fiable](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
"      * Suis [ces instructions](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) si tu souhaites te connecter via l'API REST plutôt qu'en utilisant Qiskit.\n"
"      * Si nécessaire, utilise [ces informations](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) pour configurer ton pare-feu et autoriser l'accès aux points de terminaison de l'API IBM Quantum.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Avant de commencer {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure you are working in an active Python environment with the [`qiskit` and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` packages installed](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgstr "Assure-toi de travailler dans un environnement Python actif avec les [packages `qiskit` et `qiskit-ibm-runtime` installés](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate the Python virtual environment and run Python in your virtual environment.\n"
msgstr "Active l'environnement virtuel Python et exécute Python dans cet environnement.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr "Connecte-toi à [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"find-credentials\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"find-credentials\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access credentials {#find-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Trouver tes identifiants d'accès {#find-your-access-credentials}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure that the correct account and region are selected in the account switcher in the header.\n"
msgstr "Assure-toi que le bon compte et la bonne région sont sélectionnés dans le sélecteur de compte dans l'en-tête.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your API key. From the [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), create your API key, then copy it to a secure location so you can use it for authentication. Note that you can use the same API key to connect to any region.\n"
msgstr "Trouve ta clé API. Depuis le [tableau de bord](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), crée ta clé API, puis copie-la dans un emplacement sécurisé afin de pouvoir l'utiliser pour l'authentification. Note que tu peux utiliser la même clé API pour te connecter à n'importe quelle région.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional: Find the instance you want to use from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Hover over its CRN, click the icon to copy it, then save it in a secure location so you can use it to identify the instance.\n"
msgstr "Facultatif : Trouve l'instance que tu souhaites utiliser depuis la page [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Survole son CRN, clique sur l'icône pour le copier, puis sauvegarde-le dans un emplacement sécurisé afin de pouvoir l'utiliser pour identifier l'instance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your access credentials {#save-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Sauvegarder tes identifiants d'accès {#save-your-access-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your credentials by running the appropriate code once per account you want to save. After saving your credentials, load them by following the steps in [Initialize IBM Quantum Compute Service](/guides/initialize-account).\n"
msgstr "Sauvegarde tes identifiants en exécutant le code approprié une fois par compte que tu souhaites enregistrer. Après avoir sauvegardé tes identifiants, charge-les en suivant les étapes de la page [Initialiser IBM Quantum Compute Service](/guides/initialize-account).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"save-instance\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"save-instance\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save credentials that access a specific instance: {#save-credentials-that-access-a-specific-instance}"
msgstr "Sauvegarder des identifiants qui accèdent à une instance spécifique : {#save-credentials-that-access-a-specific-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have multiple instances and want to easily tell Quantum Compute which instance to use, save credentials that include an instance CRN.\n"
msgstr "Si tu as plusieurs instances et que tu veux indiquer facilement à Quantum Compute laquelle utiliser, sauvegarde des identifiants incluant un CRN d'instance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your-api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your-api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save credentials for automatic instance selection: {#save-credentials-for-automatic-instance-selection}"
msgstr "Sauvegarder des identifiants pour la sélection automatique d'instance : {#save-credentials-for-automatic-instance-selection}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you don't provide an instance CRN and pass these credentials to Quantum Compute, an appropriate instance will be chosen for you, based on the specified options.\n"
msgstr "Si tu ne fournis pas de CRN d'instance et que tu transmets ces identifiants à Quantum Compute, une instance appropriée sera automatiquement choisie pour toi en fonction des options spécifiées.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your=api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<instance-to-use>\", # Optional\n"
"      plans_preference=\"<plan_types>\", # Optional\n"
"      region=\"<region>\", # Optional\n"
"      tags=\"<instance-tags>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your=api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<instance-to-use>\", # Optional\n"
"      plans_preference=\"<plan_types>\", # Optional\n"
"      region=\"<region>\", # Optional\n"
"      tags=\"<instance-tags>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 2 {#example-2}"
msgstr "Exemple 2 {#example-2}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example saves credentials for automatic instance selection.  Quantum Compute will only look at premium instances in the EU region that are available to the account. These credentials become the new default.\n"
msgstr "Cet exemple sauvegarde des identifiants pour la sélection automatique d'instance. Quantum Compute ne prendra en compte que les instances premium dans la région EU disponibles pour le compte. Ces identifiants deviennent le nouveau défaut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "View saved credentials {#view-saved-credentials}"
msgstr "Voir les identifiants sauvegardés {#view-saved-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To view all credentials that you have saved, run `service.saved_accounts()`.  Note that if you saved default credentials and didn't name them, they are named `default-ibm-quantum-platform`. If you did name your default credentials, you will see `\"is_default_account\": true` in the output.\n"
msgstr "Pour voir tous les identifiants que tu as sauvegardés, exécute `service.saved_accounts()`. Note que si tu as sauvegardé des identifiants par défaut sans les nommer, ils portent le nom `default-ibm-quantum-platform`. Si tu as nommé tes identifiants par défaut, tu verras `\"is_default_account\": true` dans le résultat.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Considerations {#considerations}"
msgstr "Considérations {#considerations}"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are saving multiple accounts, use the `name` parameter to differentiate them.\n"
msgstr "Si tu sauvegardes plusieurs comptes, utilise le paramètre `name` pour les différencier.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Credentials are saved to `$HOME/.qiskit/qiskit-ibm.json`.  Do not manually edit this file.\n"
msgstr "Les identifiants sont sauvegardés dans `$HOME/.qiskit/qiskit-ibm.json`. Ne modifie pas ce fichier manuellement.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you don't save your credentials, you must specify them every time you start a new session (instantiate IBM Quantum Compute Service).\n"
msgstr "Si tu ne sauvegardes pas tes identifiants, tu devras les spécifier à chaque fois que tu démarres une nouvelle session (instanciation d'IBM Quantum Compute Service).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you manually specify your credentials, a saved account will not be used.\n"
msgstr "Si tu spécifies manuellement tes identifiants, un compte sauvegardé ne sera pas utilisé.\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Étapes suivantes {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  -  [Initialize IBM Quantum Compute Service](/guides/initialize-account) in a trusted Python environment.\n"
"  -  [Initialize IBM Quantum Compute Service in an **untrusted environment**](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
"  -  [View your available QPUs](/guides/qpu-information#available).\n"
"  -  [Configure the Qiskit SDK locally](/guides/configure-qiskit-local).\n"
"  -  Follow the steps in the [Run your first circuit on hardware](/guides/hello-world) guide to write and run a quantum program.\n"
"  -  [Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"
"  -  Try a [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommandations\">\n"
"  -  [Initialiser IBM Quantum Compute Service](/guides/initialize-account) dans un environnement Python de confiance.\n"
"  -  [Initialiser IBM Quantum Compute Service dans un **environnement non fiable**.](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted)\n"
"  -  [Voir tes QPU disponibles.](/guides/qpu-information#available)\n"
"  -  [Configurer le SDK Qiskit localement.](/guides/configure-qiskit-local)\n"
"  -  Suis les étapes de [Hello world](/guides/hello-world) pour écrire et exécuter un programme quantique.\n"
"  -  [Configurer l'utilisation d'IBM Quantum Platform avec l'API REST.](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api)\n"
"  -  Essaie un [tutoriel.](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
